# Pose coverage. The roster declares facing over the closed domain north|east|south|west and the
# staging step binds it as {facing}, so all four are authored cases rather than a north-only plan;
# the gallery resolver enumerates mapping, then variant, then the four poses in that order.
DESCRIPTION=tent/fallback staged in the East pose
REQUEST=arch-gallery-slice;facing=east
SCRIPT=flatten;realize;status
EXPECT=flatten:OK,realize:OK,status:OK,COMPLETE
